EverQuest is a trademark of Daybreak Game Company LLC. This project is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Daybreak. It reads log files the
EverQuest client writes and does nothing else to the game: it never writes to
the game folder, never reads process memory, and never injects code.

